Watercolor — per-brush licensing

This package bundles 4 brush tips that were previously published as separate
packages. Each tip keeps the licence it was published under; the manifest's `license` field lists
every licence present. The text of each tip's licence follows, verbatim except that the tip's path
is its path in this package. A tip's own terms apply to that tip alone.

==============================================================================
Wet-on-Wet  (assets/watercolor-wet-on-wet.png)  —  CC0-1.0
==============================================================================

CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)

The brush tip bitmap in this package (assets/watercolor-wet-on-wet.png) is dedicated to the public
domain under the CC0 1.0 Universal license:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Tip artwork by David Revoy (davidrevoy.com), from the Krita brushes 2025-01 bundle.
Converted from the source bitmap: inverted to a grayscale-alpha PNG and packaged
as an azphalt brush asset. No other changes were made to the artwork.

The manifest, packaging code, and this LICENSE file are
Copyright (c) 2026 HereLiesAz. All rights reserved.

